==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|прѣтворити}}. {{surf|ru|пре-|твори́ть}}. Doublet of native dialectal {{doublet|ru|перетвори́ть||notext=1}}. Compare {{m+|uk|перетворити}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|претвори́ть}}
* {{homophones|ru|притвори́ть}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|претвори́ть|pf|impf=претворя́ть}}

# to [[implement]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''претвори́ть''' [[в]] [[жизнь]]/[[де́ло]]|t=to realize, to implement, to carry out, to put into practice}}
# {{lb|ru|obsolete|bookish}} to [[turn]] ''(into)'', to [[change]] ''(into)'', to [[convert]] ''(into)''

